{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"rock_sulphur","model_identifier":"rock_sulphur","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# rock_sulphur\n\nSulphur node: grey rock with yellow crusts round a steaming vent (steam is a game effect at `fx_steam`).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -43..35, y 0..39, z -34..30 units (2.19 x 1.10 x 1.80 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 27.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 78 x 39 x 64 (w x h x d), centred at x -4, z -2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): untouched node\n- `depleted`: mined out: smaller broken chunks and gravel\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck (both sets) |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_steam` at (0, 34, 0)\n- `fx_steam_depleted` at (0, 13, 0)\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"rock0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-28.0,0.0,-22.0],"to":[28.0,32.0,22.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[56.0,0.0,112.0,32.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,44.0,44.0,76.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[56.0,0.0,112.0,32.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,44.0,44.0,76.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,56.0,44.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,56.0,44.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"63c8a7dd-1ee4-5740-8bef-0635fb179d5b"},{"name":"rock0_cap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"defa